        "subheading": "From frustration to innovation",
        "title": "Designed by a pro who lives on the range",
        "content": "<p>As a professional golfer, Paul Park spent countless hours on video analysis — and just as many fighting unstable phone holders. GPOD is his answer: one-handed magnetic attachment, tour-grade stability, and hardware that disappears into your bag until you need it.</p>",
        "cta": "Read our story",
        "link": "/pages/about-us",
        "btn_type": "btn--primary",
        "btn_size": "",
        "btn_style": "btn--outline",
